					<Text value="INTERACTIVE MODE (FM Pro):&#13;  Run with no parameter. Saves XML to desktop, POSTs to localhost:8765/explode.&#13;  Requires companion server running and $$AGENTIC.FM configured.&#13;&#13;SERVER MODE (OData via AGFMScriptBridge):&#13;  Pass JSON parameter with keys:&#13;    repo_path     — absolute POSIX path to the agentic-fm project root on the companion server host&#13;    export_path   — absolute POSIX path where FMS will write the XML export (must be host-accessible)&#13;    companion_url — base URL of the companion server (e.g. http://host.docker.internal:8765)&#13;    solution_name — (optional) override solution name; defaults to Get(FileName)&#13;&#13;  NOTE: export_path must be a path FMS can write to AND the companion server host can read.&#13;  On a Linux FMS container with a host-mounted Data dir, use that mount path.&#13;  The FM path is constructed as &quot;filelinux:&quot; &amp; export_path — adjust prefix for other OS.&#13;&#13;RETURNS (server mode): companion server response JSON { success, exit_code, stdout, stderr }"></Text>
